  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T X.1057 provides guidelines for securely managing various assets, including electronic information, paper, and IT systems in telecommunication organizations. This Recommendation also describes the main activities and methods for implementing asset management on the basis of the PDCA (Plan Do Check Act) process model.</abstract>
